# BL365 core + hostile-LLM security assessment — sandbox data dirs (throwaway
# daemon data dir, audit logs, .mcp.json with a throwaway admin token). The
# *harness* (scripts/sec-assess/) and the plan docs are committed; the
# sandboxes themselves are operator-local, contain token-ish files, and must
# not land in git (AGENT.md "No local-environment leaks" + Security Rules).
.sec-sandbox/
.hllm-sandbox/
.sec-sandbox-bin/
artifacts/

